    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d326">

                <pb facs="0404" n="330" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg330"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/864</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Russia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Francis</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-12-29T14:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 29, 1917, 2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1946. Your 2138, December 24, 11 p.m. Department desires you to continue the
                    course you have pursued in the past and which it has approved. Department relies
                    on your good judgment to persevere in difficult situation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
